      "writtenOn": "2023-02-28T14:07:10Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I say lets store the USAGE flags on the VulkanBuffer. I like the idea of our various backend checks looking at the actual backend capabilities of the buffer instead of relying on a fragile connection between BufferType and what we assume the set usages are.",
